<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian meat exports mixed in Nov 96 - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian meat exports mixed in Nov 96 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for November 1996 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> November 96   7,338	68	     6,242	4,727</p>
<p> October 96    5,571     153	     7,426	5,315</p>
<p> November 95   5,316     148	     8,974	4,240</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> November 96  58,369	372	   5.017	 855</p>
<p> October 96   56,419	410	   4,702	 721</p>
<p> November 95  59,527	416	   7,333	 727</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
